| **Logging** | Never log the raw secret value. | Prevent sensitive data exposure. |
| **Rotation** | Set up automated rotation for JWT secrets and other long‑lived credentials. | Reduces the window of compromise. |
| **Audit** | Keep logs of who accessed the secret store and when. | Detects abuse or accidental exposure. |

